  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to continue strengthening the functioning of the Ozone Cell (National Ozone Unit) within the Ministry of Climate Change as a focal point in Pakistan for all matters relating to the phase-out of Ozone Depleting Substances (ODS) under the Montreal Protocol. The National Ozone Unit will follow up and implement all related activities such as legislative/regulatory measures, data reporting, mass awareness, implementation of HPMP, promotion of alternatives to CFC-based</narrative>
  </description>
